# Map working directories to scopes, so agents get the right packet automatically.
# Format: absolute path prefix<TAB>scope. Longest matching prefix wins.
# Copy to cwd-map.tsv and edit. Without this file, pass the scope explicitly:
#   spine-packet work
#
# /Users/you/code/some-product	work
# /Users/you/notes	personal
# /Users/you/dev/memory-spine	ai-infra
